<p>What can you conclude about <m>P</m> and <m>Q</m> if you knew the statement above was false?</p>
<p><var form="buttons">
<li>
<p>That <m>P</m> and <m>Q</m> are both false.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>That <m>P</m> is true and <m>Q</m> is false.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>That <m>P</m> is false and <m>Q</m> is true.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>That <m>P</m> and <m>Q</m> are both true.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>None of the above.</p>
</li>
</var></p>
</statement>
